@@ -0,0 +1,7 @@
+{
+  "issue_id": "MAGIC-LEFT-BATTLEFIELD",
+  "cause": "The Count expression had no evaluator, and the existing departure statistic recorded only all permanents, without creature characteristics.",
+  "fix": "Count creature departures using the battlefield creature status and controller captured by the move path, including tokens and each separate departure. Reset the count for every player at the global turn boundary and resolve the requested Creature.YouCtrl expression, including existing arithmetic operators.",
+  "verification": "With the new integration tests and baseline source, CARGO_TARGET_DIR=\"$SIMON_SCRATCH/target\" DYLD_SHARED_REGION=avoid cargo test -p manabrew-engine --test left_battlefield_this_turn failed both tests with the unrecognized expression. With the repair, the same command passed 2 tests. CARGO_TARGET_DIR=\"$SIMON_SCRATCH/target\" DYLD_SHARED_REGION=avoid cargo test -p manabrew-engine --test left_battlefield_this_turn --test zone_change_effects passed the 2 scoped tests but the neighboring suite aborted on a default test-thread stack overflow. RUST_MIN_STACK=16777216 CARGO_TARGET_DIR=\"$SIMON_SCRATCH/target\" DYLD_SHARED_REGION=avoid cargo test -p manabrew-engine --test zone_change_effects passed all 10 tests.",
+  "limitations": "Only the requested selector is implemented, not arbitrary LeftBattlefieldThisTurn filters. Tests exercise deterministic engine moves and a directly changed battlefield type; they do not establish every replacement or continuous-effect interaction, replay retired traces, test archived card scripts, run games, or establish candidate runtime acceptance. The count uses the move path's existing pre-replacement snapshot and therefore inherits its handling of replacement effects. Engine-wide correctness and migration are not established."
+}
